        "type": "self-check"
      },
      "answerText": "Use IN 3 two times, then IN 1",
      "solution": [
        "IN 3 with c < 0: ac > bc.",
        "IN 3 with b < 0: bc > bd.",
        "IN 1: ac > bd."
      ],
      "langType": "§4 ex. 3",
      "hints": [
        "Multiply by a negative number two times."
      ]
